###  Commits on Jun 23, 2025 

  * ####  [ parser: Remove unnecessary dict checks when freeing strings ](/GNOME/libxml2/commit/7c91385040ffab197f92135f7240e4d86b8f0cbb "parser: Remove unnecessary dict checks when freeing strings

The following strings are never allocated from a dict:

- xmlParserCtxt.version
- xmlParserCtxt.encoding
- xmlParserCtxt.extSubURI
- xmlParserCtxt.extSubSystem
- xmlDoc.version
- xmlDoc.encoding
- xmlDoc.URL
- xmlDTD.ExternalID
- xmlDTD.SystemID
- xmlID.value

Also make the struct members point to non-const chars to avoid casts
when freeing.")

